  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen the National Institute of Social Services for Retirees and Pensioners</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento del Instituto Nacional de Servicios Sociales para Jubilados y Pensionados</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Objetivo General de Desarrollo del Programa es contribuir a mejorar la calidad de vida relacionada con la salud de la poblacin afiliada al INSSJP. El Objetivo Especfico del programa es reducir las brechas en oportunidad y calidad en la atencin en salud y cuidados de la poblacin afiliada al INSSJP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The General Development Objective of the Program is to contribute to improving the health-related quality of life of the population affiliated with the INSSJP. The Specific Objective of the program is to reduce the gaps in the timeliness and quality of health care and services for the population affiliated with the INSSJP.</narrative>
  </description>
